// Sacred Bill Tracker — secrets template (COMMITTED, safe).
// 1. Copy this file to `Secrets.xcconfig` (same folder).
// 2. Replace the placeholder with your real AppsFlyer Dev Key.
// `Secrets.xcconfig` is git-ignored — never commit the real key.
//
// The app reads APPSFLYER_DEV_KEY via Info.plist key "AppsFlyerDevKey" = $(APPSFLYER_DEV_KEY).
// If the value is missing or still a placeholder, AppsFlyer will NOT start (safe no-op).
APPSFLYER_DEV_KEY = paste_real_key_here

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// TikTok Business SDK (App Events)
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Surfaced to the app via Info.plist:
//   TikTokAccessToken = $(TIKTOK_ACCESS_TOKEN)   <- SECRET
//   TikTokAppID       = $(TIKTOK_APP_ID)         <- TikTok App ID (Events Manager)
//
// The Apple App Store ID (6762890363) is a public constant in the code and is
// NOT configured here.
//
// If either value is missing or still a placeholder, the TikTok SDK will NOT
// initialize (safe no-op) and no events are sent.
//
// Where to get them: TikTok Events Manager -> Data sources -> iOS data source
// 6762890363. "Copy the TikTok App ID" yields TIKTOK_APP_ID; the access token is
// generated for that same data source.
//
// NOTE: xcconfig treats `//` as the start of a comment — values must not contain `//`.
TIKTOK_ACCESS_TOKEN = TIKTOK_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
TIKTOK_APP_ID = TIKTOK_APP_ID_HERE
